// docs/specs/phase5/vehicle-designer.md 3.1, 4.2, 4.3 (P5-G): the recipes of the vehicle parts the Phase 3 and P5-E recipes do not make, and the repair lines of vehicle parts.
// A part recipe's result is a vehicle_part item row; it is installed on a vehicle site (install_h on the part). Cartwright for frames, beds, shafts and poles; wheelwright for wheels and axles;
// shipwright for hull planks, keels, masts and rudders (at the slipway); tyre shrinking is P5-E's forge_iron_tyre. Repairs are the repair_cart effect: +300 permille of the part's hit points.
